title: to recover from a skid
pid: 4a9f6543-a02b-419e-afeb-ce6900051e81
body: |2-
  - Slowly remove your foot from the accelerator.
  - Do not use the brakes.
  - Turn the steering wheel in the direction the car's rear did.
  - Don't overcorrect -- that can cause an opposite skid.
  - Try to get a wheel on dry pavement.
